{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0283_1004_003mik", "source_sha256": "6329c83c5a2f56fbf4f8ebb23a0f2a57211b9f95b95c28202f6574a67b9e1672", "ja": "ひとりで帰っても意味ないの。\n放課後デートは、ふたりでするものでしょ？", "zh": "一个人回去也没有意义呀。\n放学后的约会，就是要两个人一起才行吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0283_1005_p", "source_sha256": "4161249b90d3e23e3ef5082904f368c559cfb6e1d3e1ce3fa568d7116358e9e7", "ja": "放課後デート……？", "zh": "放学后的约会……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0283_1006_003mik", "source_sha256": "7cddfa72cf6d17fc547b0f3ba0669f8295cb01513a1217f303f6a730c5411e1b", "ja": "うん！　ミキの友達なんて、クラスの男子と\n毎日、放課後デートしてるんだって！", "zh": "嗯！听说美希的朋友每天都和班上的男生放学后约会呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0283_1007_003mik", "source_sha256": "9bf4ce3e98b81174228e6de98eaadafb931caf2d9caaeec3f970d1509ed105e7", "ja": "だからね、ミキも{$P$}と一緒に\n放課後デートしてみたいなって。", "zh": "所以啊，美希也想和{$P$}一起放学后约会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0283_1008_p", "source_sha256": "5eb20918000b47621653d1de56555180d297a457174a18475238798d64b74c3e", "ja": "なるほど、理由はわかった。でも仕事が終わって、\n一緒に帰るだけだから、別にデートじゃ……。", "zh": "原来如此，我明白理由了。不过工作结束后，只是一起回去而已，所以应该算不上约会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0283_1009_003mik", "source_sha256": "3132c75dcea43d32334452becc79931225e132a815312d2b26bebde12da5ed55", "ja": "細かいコトはいいの！　学校から帰るんだから、\nミキ的には、放課後デートでいいって思うな。", "zh": "细节就别在意啦！既然是放学回家，在美希看来，说是放学后约会也没什么不好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0283_1010_003mik", "source_sha256": "10e5e6f742b89f099e964d3c528d06f2813213a9498b5077eff8fd97ae17264f", "ja": "ホントは、屋上で一緒にお昼寝したかったけど……。\nそれは、また今度ね♪", "zh": "其实，本来想和你一起在屋顶睡午觉的……不过，下次再一起吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0283_1011_p", "source_sha256": "2935f9f4d5f40b15112167ed25a6837dd20a224c014e38ccad54eae9b1b13d10", "ja": "今度があるかは、わからないが……。うーん……。\nとりあえず、放課後デートって何をするんだ？", "zh": "虽然不知道下次还会不会有……嗯……\n总之，放学后的约会要做些什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0283_1012_003mik", "source_sha256": "bfe9136cb6b687c7c3fba126917c41a7f2491eea0e2a4fbf126f3dd6da514120", "ja": "えっとね……カラオケしたり、ショッピング、とか？\nああ！　ミキ、タピオカ屋さんに行きたい！", "zh": "那个……唱唱卡拉OK，逛逛街之类的？\n啊！美希想去珍珠奶茶店！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0283_1013_003mik", "source_sha256": "b83f858e85f3bd45588c295e5adc5b4bfa7ed9a229ab80903c58b017093959c2", "ja": "放課後デート、すっごく楽しみにしてたの。\nだから撮影も、ミキなりに頑張ったんだよ？", "zh": "我一直特别期待放学后的约会。\n所以拍摄的时候，美希也按照自己的方式努力了哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0283_1014_p", "source_sha256": "b8d5b7914f459aa4b876170eee79e3faa2ecc815e49aa7b97b023dc55e68714f", "ja": "最終日だから集中してるのかと思ったら……。まあ、\n美希が頑張ったのは確かだし、少しだけ付き合うよ。", "zh": "我还以为你是因为最后一天才这么专注呢……不过，美希确实努力了，就陪你一会儿吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0283_1015_003mik", "source_sha256": "9c8c40122823aad3350f2b4e8fba19ff99b15f60bc12874faa7b3e1c11195961", "ja": "やったやったやったぁ♪　じゃあ、ハニーは今から\nミキのクラスメイトね！　それとも、先輩がいい？", "zh": "太好啦太好啦太好啦～♪　那Honey从现在起\n就是美希的同班同学了！　还是说，当学长比较好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0283_1016_003mik", "source_sha256": "539e7cd8125e2f2c8ebf5a591e08f9964eeadba2a0ca5fecdc990818587f2ed1", "ja": "ま、どっちでもいっか。\n放課後デート、いーっぱい楽しもうね。あはっ☆", "zh": "嘛，哪个都行啦。\n放学后的约会，要尽情享受哦。啊哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
